    "body": "{\"project\":{\"id\":\"a1b2c3d4e5f60718293a4b5c6d7e8f90\",\"name\":\"agent-board\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-01T07:00:00Z\"},\"version\":\"mock-1\",\"cursor\":\"f1:a1b2c3d4e5f60718293a4b5c6d7e8f90:mock-1\",\"epics\":[{\"id\":\"FILE-SHARE\",\"name\":\"File share\",\"color\":\"#7C3AED\",\"isDraft\":false,\"document\":\"## 目的\\n\\n共有ファイルの画面を整える。\\n\\n## 進め方\\n\\n順に進める。\\n\\n## 参考条件\\n\\n- [x] 本文が読める\\n- [ ] 画像が並ぶ\\n\",\"body\":\"## 目的\\n\\n共有ファイルの画面を整える。\\n\\n## 進め方\\n\\n順に進める。\\n\\n## 参考条件\\n\\n- [x] 本文が読める\\n- [ ] 画像が並ぶ\\n\",\"priority\":[],\"priorityError\":false,\"attachments\":[],\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-01T07:00:00Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-01T07:00:00Z\"}],\"epicTaskCounts\":{\"FILE-SHARE\":{\"todo\":1,\"doing\":2,\"done\":0,\"archived\":0,\"total\":3}},\"tasks\":[{\"id\":8,\"title\":\"Initialize the board\",\"description\":\"Create the storage for the board with agboard init.\",\"position\":1,\"assignee\":\"ai\",\"taskStatus\":\"done\",\"agentStatus\":\"idle\",\"pendingReason\":null,\"pendingRequestId\":null,\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-01T16:00:00Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-02T09:48:00Z\",\"agentStatusChangedAt\":\"2026-10-01T16:00:00Z\",\"isDraft\":false,\"history\":[{\"at\":\"2026-10-01T16:00:00Z\",\"reason\":\"Created task in Todo.\"},{\"at\":\"2026-10-01T16:30:00Z\",\"reason\":\"Moved task from Todo to Doing.\"},{\"at\":\"2026-10-02T09:48:00Z\",\"reason\":\"Moved task from Doing to Done.\"}],\"pendingChoices\":[],\"body\":\"Create the storage for the board with agboard init.\",\"acceptance\":[],\"acceptanceError\":false,\"taskStatusChangedAt\":\"2026-10-02T09:48:00Z\",\"epicId\":null},{\"id\":9,\"title\":\"Return the task list as JSON\",\"description\":\"Print the tasks as JSON so that agents can read them.\",\"position\":2,\"assignee\":\"ai\",\"taskStatus\":\"done\",\"agentStatus\":\"idle\",\"pendingReason\":null,\"pendingRequestId\":null,\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-01T16:10:00Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-02T10:02:00Z\",\"agentStatusChangedAt\":\"2026-10-01T16:10:00Z\",\"isDraft\":false,\"history\":[{\"at\":\"2026-10-01T16:10:00Z\",\"reason\":\"Created task in Todo.\"},{\"at\":\"2026-10-01T17:00:00Z\",\"reason\":\"Moved task from Todo to Doing.\"},{\"at\":\"2026-10-02T10:02:00Z\",\"reason\":\"Moved task from Doing to Done.\"}],\"pendingChoices\":[],\"body\":\"Print the tasks as JSON so that agents can read them.\",\"acceptance\":[],\"acceptanceError\":false,\"taskStatusChangedAt\":\"2026-10-02T10:02:00Z\",\"epicId\":null},{\"id\":11,\"title\":\"Implement task moves\",\"description\":\"Move a task to another column and record the transition.\",\"position\":1,\"assignee\":\"ai\",\"taskStatus\":\"doing\",\"agentStatus\":\"pending\",\"pendingReason\":\"Waiting for a decision on how to order the task moves.\",\"pendingRequestId\":\"11111111111111111111111111111111\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-01T16:00:00Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-02T10:42:00Z\",\"agentStatusChangedAt\":\"2026-10-02T10:42:00Z\",\"isDraft\":false,\"history\":[{\"at\":\"2026-10-01T16:00:00Z\",\"reason\":\"Created task in Todo.\"},{\"at\":\"2026-10-01T16:30:00Z\",\"reason\":\"Moved task from Todo to Doing.\"},{\"at\":\"2026-10-02T10:42:00Z\",\"reason\":\"Working on this task\"}],\"pendingChoices\":[{\"id\":\"fifo\",\"label\":\"Keep the order they were moved in\"},{\"id\":\"priority\",\"label\":\"Sort by priority\"}],\"body\":\"Move a task to another column and record the transition.\",\"acceptance\":[{\"id\":\"AC-1\",\"text\":\"Tasks move between lanes\",\"done\":true},{\"id\":\"AC-2\",\"text\":\"Each move confirms the status change\",\"done\":true},{\"id\":\"AC-3\",\"text\":\"The history keeps the reason\",\"done\":false},{\"id\":\"AC-4\",\"text\":\"A waiting task goes back to idle\",\"done\":false}],\"acceptanceError\":false,\"taskStatusChangedAt\":\"2026-10-01T16:30:00Z\",\"epicId\":\"FILE-SHARE\"},{\"id\":12,\"title\":\"Restore a board from JSON\",\"description\":\"\",\"position\":2,\"assignee\":\"ai\",\"taskStatus\":\"doing\",\"agentStatus\":\"pending\",\"pendingReason\":\"Waiting for confirmation on how to replace a board.\",\"pendingRequestId\":\"0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-02T00:20:00Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-02T10:36:00Z\",\"agentStatusChangedAt\":\"2026-10-02T10:36:00Z\",\"isDraft\":false,\"history\":[{\"at\":\"2026-10-02T00:20:00Z\",\"reason\":\"Created task in Todo.\"},{\"at\":\"2026-10-02T01:10:00Z\",\"reason\":\"Moved task from Todo to Doing.\"},{\"at\":\"2026-10-02T10:36:00Z\",\"reason\":\"Waiting for confirmation on how to replace a board.\"}],\"pendingChoices\":[{\"id\":\"keep\",\"label\":\"Keep the data\"},{\"id\":\"reset\",\"label\":\"Start over\"}],\"body\":\"\",\"acceptance\":[{\"id\":\"AC-1\",\"text\":\"The board shows the restore\",\"done\":true},{\"id\":\"AC-2\",\"text\":\"The archive keeps the lane\",\"done\":true}],\"acceptanceError\":false,\"taskStatusChangedAt\":\"2026-10-02T01:10:00Z\",\"epicId\":\"FILE-SHARE\"},{\"id\":13,\"title\":\"Check the board display\",\"description\":\"Check the layout at 1280, 800, and 480 px.\\nLook for horizontal scrolling.\",\"position\":3,\"assignee\":\"ai\",\"taskStatus\":\"doing\",\"agentStatus\":\"pending\",\"pendingReason\":\"Waiting for confirmation on which display to check.\",\"pendingRequestId\":\"13131313131313131313131313131313\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-02T02:00:00Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-02T10:12:00Z\",\"agentStatusChangedAt\":\"2026-10-02T02:00:00Z\",\"isDraft\":false,\"history\":[{\"at\":\"2026-10-02T02:00:00Z\",\"reason\":\"Created task in Todo.\"},{\"at\":\"2026-10-02T10:12:00Z\",\"reason\":\"Moved task from Todo to Doing.\"}],\"pendingChoices\":[{\"id\":\"board\",\"label\":\"The board view\"},{\"id\":\"archive\",\"label\":\"The archive view\"}],\"body\":\"Check the layout at 1280, 800, and 480 px.\\nLook for horizontal scrolling.\",\"acceptance\":[],\"acceptanceError\":false,\"taskStatusChangedAt\":\"2026-10-02T10:12:00Z\",\"epicId\":null},{\"id\":14,\"title\":\"Prepare the Windows build\",\"description\":\"Build Agent Board for Windows x64.\",\"position\":1,\"assignee\":\"human\",\"taskStatus\":\"todo\",\"agentStatus\":\"idle\",\"pendingReason\":null,\"pendingRequestId\":null,\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-02T03:00:00Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-02T10:08:00Z\",\"agentStatusChangedAt\":\"2026-10-02T03:00:00Z\",\"isDraft\":false,\"history\":[{\"at\":\"2026-10-02T03:00:00Z\",\"reason\":\"Created task in Todo.\"}],\"pendingChoices\":[],\"body\":\"Build Agent Board for Windows x64.\",\"acceptance\":[],\"acceptanceError\":false,\"taskStatusChangedAt\":\"2026-10-02T03:00:00Z\",\"epicId\":\"FILE-SHARE\"},{\"id\":15,\"title\":\"Write the setup guide\",\"description\":\"\",\"position\":2,\"assignee\":\"ai\",\"taskStatus\":\"todo\",\"agentStatus\":\"idle\",\"pendingReason\":null,\"pendingRequestId\":null,\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-02T09:25:00Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-02T09:25:00Z\",\"agentStatusChangedAt\":\"2026-10-02T09:25:00Z\",\"isDraft\":false,\"history\":[{\"at\":\"2026-10-02T09:25:00Z\",\"reason\":\"Created task in Todo.\"}],\"pendingChoices\":[],\"body\":\"\",\"acceptance\":[],\"acceptanceError\":false,\"taskStatusChangedAt\":\"2026-10-02T09:25:00Z\",\"epicId\":null},{\"id\":16,\"title\":\"Refine the empty board\",\"description\":\"\",\"position\":3,\"assignee\":\"ai\",\"taskStatus\":\"todo\",\"agentStatus\":\"idle\",\"pendingReason\":null,\"pendingRequestId\":null,\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-02T09:30:00Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-02T09:30:00Z\",\"agentStatusChangedAt\":\"2026-10-02T09:30:00Z\",\"isDraft\":false,\"history\":[{\"at\":\"2026-10-02T09:30:00Z\",\"reason\":\"Created task in Todo.\"}],\"pendingChoices\":[],\"body\":\"\",\"acceptance\":[],\"acceptanceError\":false,\"taskStatusChangedAt\":\"2026-10-02T09:30:00Z\",\"epicId\":null},{\"id\":17,\"title\":\"Long Markdown description\",\"description\":\"Plan for the board setup. Single line breaks\\nare kept as line breaks.\\n\\n## Purpose\\nCreate the board storage with `agboard init`. When the storage already exists, change nothing.\\n\\n### Notes\\nHeadings below H2 stay inside their section.\\n\\n## Acceptance criteria\\n- [x] A board can be created in a new data area\\n- [x] An existing board is not changed\\n- [ ] An error is reported when the storage cannot be written\\n  - [ ] The message names the path\\n\\n## Steps\\n1. Check that the storage exists\\n2. Create the board when it does not\\n3. Show the result\\n\\n## Verification\\n| Scenario | Expected | AC |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| First run | A board is created and the command exits with a very long explanatory message that needs scrolling | AC-1 |\\n| Second run | Nothing changes | AC-2 |\\n\\n```sh\\nAGBOARD_HOME=$(mktemp -d) agboard init --name a-very-long-board-name-that-does-not-wrap --description \\\"long line\\\"\\n```\\n\\n> Quoted note from a review.\\n\\n~~Dropped~~ [External link](https://example.com/docs) and [bad link](javascript:alert(1)).\\n\\n![Unreachable picture](https://example.invalid/picture.png)\\n\\n<script>alert('not run')</script>\\n\",\"position\":4,\"assignee\":\"ai\",\"taskStatus\":\"todo\",\"agentStatus\":\"idle\",\"pendingReason\":null,\"pendingRequestId\":null,\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-01T16:00:00Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-02T09:48:00Z\",\"agentStatusChangedAt\":\"2026-10-01T16:00:00Z\",\"isDraft\":false,\"history\":[{\"at\":\"2026-10-01T16:00:00Z\",\"reason\":\"Created task in Todo.\"},{\"at\":\"2026-10-01T16:30:00Z\",\"reason\":\"Moved task from Todo to Doing.\"},{\"at\":\"2026-10-02T09:48:00Z\",\"reason\":\"Moved task from Doing to Done.\"}],\"pendingChoices\":[],\"body\":\"Create the storage for the board with agboard init.\",\"acceptance\":[],\"acceptanceError\":false,\"taskStatusChangedAt\":\"2026-10-02T09:48:00Z\",\"epicId\":null}],\"problems\":[]}"
